title: "P03 API proxy request authorization"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: platform processing
    lg1: platform rejection
    lg2: business
    lg3: Breaks ExecutionRequiresUniqueRoute or ExecutionRequiresWhitelist in some cases
    lg4: Path to the ExecutionRequiresUniqueRoute or ExecutionRequiresWhitelist bug
  }
  class lg0 blue
  class lg1 orange
  class lg2 purple
  class lg3 mayBreak
  class lg4 bugPath
  s0: Ready for next request
  s1: Raw path and query parsed
  s2: Rejected: no unique route
  s3: One operation uniquely matched
  s4: Business request executed
  s5: Rejected: operation disabled
  s6: Operation whitelist passed
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: a caller sends the proxy request
  s1 --> s3: one raw template wins [when static precedence makes it unique]
  s1 --> s2: the proxy rejects the request [when no route is unique]
  s2 --> s0: the proxy records the result and takes the next request
  s2 --> s4: the broken variant executes one of the ambiguous routes
  s3 --> s5: the proxy rejects the operation [when any whitelist layer disables it]
  s3 --> s4: the broken variant skips the whitelist
  s3 --> s6: overrides, profile, and instance all allow the operation
  s4 --> s0: the proxy records the result and takes the next request
  s5 --> s0: the proxy records the result and takes the next request
  s6 --> s4: the proxy executes with raw path and query preserved
